### Artificial intelligence

| Project | Status | Engineering focus |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [AgentVerse](https://github.com/Baglare/AgentVerse) · [Case study](https://artifacthub.baglare.com.tr/artifacts/agentverse/) | Research prototype | Persistent agent identities, versioned learned skills, seeded reinforcement learning, and controlled transfer experiments. Python, Gymnasium, Q-learning. |
